{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"73907d4e73b234ea5302c50e36bcf700162248e945690c377ccd232056b6da2a","digest":{"component_or_area":"rebar reconciler repair control","key_entities":["refs/reconciler/gate","refs/reconciler/lock","read_pause_with_oid","read_pause","rebar fsck --repair","rebar doctor --repair","repair:<surface>:<uuid4>","identity._git_email","_ref_lock.py","fsck_repair.py","doctor.py","test_advisory_lock_ref_backend.py","test_concurrency_regression.py"],"problem_keywords":["destructive repair","pause ownership","provider-neutral","safety mechanism","durable ref","CAS write","cleanup","fail-closed"],"propositions":["Destructive repair (`fsck --repair` and `doctor --repair`) must acquire and own a durable pause via `refs/reconciler/gate` before mutation, replacing GitHub CLI workflow disable/enable dependency.","Pause acquisition is fail-closed: missing git email, pre-existing pause, CAS uncertainty, held/corrupt lock, or transport failure aborts before any mutation.","Pause cleanup must re-snapshot the pause document and OID, compare reason to invocation token, and CAS-delete only the observed OID without retry or recreation.","Repair paused state must be honored and tested across local, GitHub Actions, Jenkins, GitLab, and bare-remote environments without `gh` binary.","Successful repair ownership prevents concurrent actors from clearing the pause, and failed cleanup leaves the pause in place for operator recovery."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787675203787258001,"uuid":"1ac537d0-0ee4-4da4-aa73-ac8cc8997bf8"}